### Ingestion status

```http
GET /api/v1/integration-status
```

Checks whether the current workspace has active event ingestion, recent activity, and third-party connector readiness.

#### Response example

```json
{
  "ok": true,
  "ingestion": "connected",
  "eventCount": 42,
  "latestEvent": "2026-10-28T14:30:00.000Z",
  "supermemory": true,
  "dodo": true
}
```

